{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Implement 10 SOS Magic: The Gathering cards in `/workspace/cards/sos/`: collector numbers 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257. Each card directory has a `card_spec.json` (oracle text/metadata) and a `card_impl.py` stub to fill in. Use completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as examples. Refer to `RULEBOOK.txt` and follow the inherited `/workspace/PLAN.md` (which contains exact engine-gap specs G1–G8, FDN analogues, and per-card plans).\n\n   Methodology constraints (verbatim intent, MUST continue to apply):\n   - Strict TDD using the `tdd` skill: write ONE failing test through the engine's public interface (test_utils), watch it fail (red), write minimal code (green), repeat. Do NOT write all tests up front.\n   - Test the real engine, not a stand-in. Drive cards the way a player would, through test_utils.\n   - Reuse before you add; mirror the nearest FDN card; keep engine edits minimal and shared.\n   - Requirements are source of truth — re-check oracle clauses against card_spec.json + RULEBOOK.txt.\n   - **Guard the engine: after each card and after any engine/ change, run `python3 -m pytest engine_tests/ -q` — never ship a regression (baseline is 1145 passing).**\n   - **Do NOT modify anything under `engine_tests/` (grader uses authoritative copies). Do NOT modify or add FDN `cards/fdn/fdn_*/tests.py`.**\n   - **Additive-only engine modifications**: may add methods/classes/helpers/files inside engine/ and modify bodies of existing functions, but MUST NOT rename/move/delete existing engine symbols. Card class names in `cards/sos/sos_<N>/card_impl.py` must not change. SOS tests go at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py`, max 30 per card.\n   - The final user message: respond TEXT ONLY (this summary), no tool calls.\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MTG mechanics: Converge, Affinity, cost reduction, Casualty, counter spells, delayed triggers, Miracle, Paradigm, Prepared, Surveil, planeswalker loyalty, skip-turns, land animation, spell copying, graveyard→exile redirection, coin flips, reanimation.\n   - Engine hooks: cost_reduction(game)->int, grants_cost_reduction(game, card)->int, on_resolve (via self.chosen_targets), get_targets, can_cast, register_triggers, register_replacement_effects, get_activated_abilities, get_mana_abilities (Land), get_loyalty_abilities (Planeswalker), _reset_characteristics.\n   - Trigger system: TriggerManager.register(TriggerRegistration(event_type, condition, effect, source, controller)); fire_event pushes matching trigger StackObjects.\n   - Events: SpellCastTriggeredEvent (spell/player/card/controller — fired by cast_spell & cast_spell_free, G1 done), BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent (player — G2 done), DrawsCardTriggeredEvent (player/card), BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent (fires for BOTH players, check game.active_player), AttacksTriggeredEvent, MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent.\n   - Continuous effects 7-layer: Layer.TYPE=4, Layer.POWER_TOUGHNESS=7, SubLayer.SET_PT (7b)/MODIFY_PT (7c), DURATION_PERMANENT=-1, DURATION_END_OF_TURN=0. EffectManager.add/apply_all (apply_all calls _reset_objects→each obj._reset_characteristics, then sorted effects); remove_expired sweeps DURATION_END_OF_TURN at cleanup.\n   - Abilities: ActivatedAbility(cost, effect, description) & ManaAbility(cost, mana_produced, description) & LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost, effect, description) are card.py dataclasses returned by hooks. Runtime: ActivatedAbilityInstance/LoyaltyAbilityInstance (abilities.py) activated via activate_ability(game, player, instance). cost callable signature is (game, source)->bool. Mana abilities resolve immediately; others push StackObject(on_resolve=ability.effect). Loyalty: sorcery-speed + once-per-turn enforced; clear_loyalty_tracking() resets module-level tracker; activate_ability adjusts source.loyalty by loyalty_cost (rejects if <0).\n   - Loyalty/ability targeting convention: effects read targets from source attributes `pw._resolve_target` (single) / `pw._resolve_targets` (list); tests set these before activating (fdn_44 pattern).\n   - Casting: cast_spell stores card.colors_spent; clamps cost reduction to generic; fires SpellCastTriggeredEvent after push. cast_spell_free(game, player, card, from_zone) for free casts. ManaCost.cmc = mana value. ManaCost(generic=, pips=, x_count=, hybrid=).\n   - test_utils: create_game, set_board_state (battlefield/hand/graveyard/life/mana only — NOT library), cast_spell (resolves whole stack; requires empty stack; instants skip sorcery-speed setup), _resolve_top_of_stack (pop+on_resolve+SBA until empty). DeterministicPlayer pops all choices from one FIFO `_script` deque.\n   - ZoneContainer: index 0 = bottom, index -1 = top; add(position=\"top\"/\"bottom\"); top(n) returns last n (bottom-to-top order). move_to_zone(game, card, from_zone, to_zone, replacement_event=None).\n   - game_state: extra_turns FIFO; _normal_next_index alternates 0/1; turn rotation in advance_phase; _TURN_SEQUENCE has 12 entries (12 advance_phase calls = one full turn).\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_257/card_impl.py` (CREATED, DONE):\n     - GreatHallOfTheBiblioplex(Land). __init__ sets name + rules_text, then creature scaffolding: base_power=0, base_toughness=0, modified_power=0, modified_toughness=0, plus_one_counters=0, minus_one_counters=0, damage_marked=0, summoning_sick=True, is_attacking=False, is_blocking=False, is_token=False, _animated=False, _original_subtypes=frozenset(self.subtypes).\n     - `power`/`toughness` properties = modified + plus_one - minus_one.\n     - `_reset_characteristics`: super() then resets modified_power/toughness to base and subtypes to _original_subtypes (so PERMANENT TYPE effect re-adds CREATURE+Wizard e