ast_spell but paying alt_cost instead of card.mana_cost (still run targets/on_cast/push/fire G1). No code for sos_201 or G6 has been written yet.\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Add the G6 helper to `/workspace/engine/casting.py` per PLAN.md: \"**G6. Cast for an alternative cost (miracle {2})** | New helper `cast_spell_alt_cost(game, player, card, from_zone, alt_cost: ManaCost)` in `engine/casting.py`: same body as `cast_spell` but pay `alt_cost` instead of `card.mana_cost` (still run targets/`on_cast`/push/fire G1).\" Then run `python3 -m pytest engine_tests/ -q` (must stay 1145), then write `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py` (properties first, confirm red), and implement `LoreholdTheHistorian(Creature)` incrementally per the PLAN.md sos_201 plan: \"keywords = Keyword.FLYING | Keyword.HASTE. register_triggers registers two triggers: 1. Miracle on DrawsCardTriggeredEvent: condition = event.player is self.controller AND getattr(event.player, 'cards_drawn_this_turn', 0) == 1 AND the drawn card's types include INSTANT/SORCERY. Effect: offer controller.choose_yes_no; if yes, cast_spell_alt_cost(game, controller, card, Zone.HAND, ManaCost(generic=2)). 2. Loot on BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent: condition = game.active_player is not self.controller. Effect: optional discard via choose_yes_no + choose_card → discard, then draw_card.\" Run `python3 -m pytest cards/sos/sos_201/tests.py -q` then `python3 -m pytest engine_tests/ -q`. This directly continues task #9 which is in_progress.\n\nIf you need specific details from before compaction (like exact code snippets, error messages, or content you generated), read the full transcript at: /home/node/.claude/projects/-workspace/a8998a71-cb9f-462b-a621-0c4f4edc8cf2.jsonl\nContinue the conversation from where it left off without asking the user any further questions. Resume directly — do not acknowledge the summary, do not recap what was happening, do not preface with \"I'll continue\" or similar. Pick up the last task as if th